    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronouns: three ways to say «we»",
     "texto": [
      "**tụi mình**: an informal form, especially common in the south; it usually includes the person you're speaking to. In the north **chúng mình** is common.",
      "**chúng ta**: «we» including you (the listener).",
      "**chúng tôi**: «we» not including the listener. The main difference between **chúng ta** and **chúng tôi** is who is part of the group, not the degree of formality."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
